            "review_title": "Review at Mango Beer Club",
            "review_text": "Discover09407172800\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nAvoid the restaurant\nJul 2023 • Family\nWe only visited the restaurant but it was very poor. We were only given the \"western\" menu and the pizza was not cooked. Having seen some other people eating local food, we asked of there was another menu - there was - they just hadn't offered it to us.\nThey charged us for the pizza as we had eaten one mouthful, and also 50,000 VND per case for storage for 3 hours, and 10,000 vnd for a paper map. Do NOT go here to eat unless you have to. We were getting a night train hence stopped there as it was convenient, but would not go again.\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
