            "review_text": "Wasinee H\n2 contributions\n0\nHorrible food!\nApr 2017 • Couples\nSuch a shame they are in the best location you could ever had to serve the travellers. It's right next to Hà Nội Railway station. They couldn't serve you food, I mean what they serve, you couldn't call it food. They didn't know how to cook simple things like spring rolls. The food they serve is the worst compared to any other food in Vietnam or any other western dishes. I even admired that Vietnamese food is as good as Thai but this place can't cook!! Seriously they need to change the cooks or close it down!! It's unacceptable!!! And the prices are highway robbery! PS. We needed to eat the food even though it's the worst food I've ever eaten as we were catching the night train! Please don't make the same mistake as I did!\nRead more\nWritten April 12, 2017",
